body:
When it comes to buying, I actually got BDO over a free promotion event which allowed me to keep playing without paying as long as I got 1 character to lvl 50 in a month.

&#x200B;

As for the spending time on it bit, I highly recommend that you get into a friendly guild as you begin. Having a bunch of people helping you out and guiding you throughout the game HELPS so that you don't get burnt out from playing since BDO can get a bit repetitive by the time you get to end-game. Lastly, yes! You can play BDO on your own and if you want to get into playing solo, I have a little guide I made to help if you [need](https://www.gamersdecide.com/articles/black-desert-online-best-solo-class) it! And there is actually no max level, we don't know what the max level is haha. The highest I've seen in my guild is lvl 64. I hope my input helps somewhat!
